BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.EnergyIdentities.moving_frame","signature":"∀ {n r : ℕ} (B : BfgsVerification.Mat n) (g y s : BfgsVerification.Vec n) (q t : ℝ),\n  Matrix.IsSymm (B - q⁻¹ • BfgsVerification.outer g g) →\n    Matrix.mulVec (B - q⁻¹ • BfgsVerification.outer g g) s = 0 →\n      ∀ (V W : Matrix (Fin n) (Fin r) ℝ) (T : BfgsVerification.Mat r) (b : BfgsVerification.Vec r),\n        W = V * T + BfgsVerification.EnergyIdentities.rectOuter s b →\n          BfgsVerification.metricGram (B - q⁻¹ • BfgsVerification.outer g g + t⁻¹ • BfgsVerification.outer y y) W =\n            Matrix.transpose T *\n                  (BfgsVerification.metricGram B V -\n                    q⁻¹ • BfgsVerification.outer (V.transpose.mulVec g) (V.transpose.mulVec g)) *\n                T +\n              t⁻¹ • BfgsVerification.outer (W.transpose.mulVec y) (W.transpose.mulVec y)","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
