BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.strict_accept_equiv","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} (A : BfgsVerification.Mat n) (hA : Matrix.det A ≠ 0) {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ}\n  (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F) (k : ℕ),\n  BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.objective A F ((BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.run A hA R).x (k + 1)) <\n        BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.objective A F ((BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.run A hA R).x k) +\n          R.c₁ *\n            BfgsVerification.dot ((BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.run A hA R).g k)\n              (BfgsVerification.bfgsStep ((BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.run A hA R).H k)\n                ((BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.run A hA R).g k)\n                ((BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.run A hA R).α k)) ∧\n      R.c₂ *\n          BfgsVerification.dot ((BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.run A hA R).g k)\n            (BfgsVerification.bfgsStep ((BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.run A hA R).H k)\n              ((BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.run A hA R).g k) ((BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.run A hA R).α k)) <\n        BfgsVerification.dot ((BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.run A hA R).g (k + 1))\n          (BfgsVerification.bfgsStep ((BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.run A hA R).H k)\n            ((BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.run A hA R).g k) ((BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.run A hA R).α k)) ↔\n    F (R.x (k + 1)) <\n        F (R.x k) + R.c₁ * BfgsVerification.dot (R.g k) (BfgsVerification.bfgsStep (R.H k) (R.g k) (R.α k)) ∧\n      R.c₂ * BfgsVerification.dot (R.g k) (BfgsVerification.bfgsStep (R.H k) (R.g k) (R.α k)) <\n        BfgsVerification.dot (R.g (k + 1)) (BfgsVerification.bfgsStep (R.H k) (R.g k) (R.α k))","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
