BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.eventually_structured_field_transport","signature":"∀ {F : BfgsVerification.Vec 2 → ℝ} (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun 2 F),\n  IsCompact R.initialSublevel →\n    Filter.Tendsto R.displacement Filter.atTop (nhds 0) →\n      ∀ {m : ℕ} {χ : Fin m → BfgsVerification.Vec 2 → ℝ} {v : Fin m → ℝ → BfgsVerification.Vec 2},\n        (∀ (i : Fin m), ContDiff ℝ (↑⊤) (χ i)) →\n          ∀ {N : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec 2)},\n            IsOpen N →\n              BfgsVerification.ClusterSetGeometry.clusterSet R.x ⊆ N →\n                ∀ {η : ℝ},\n                  0 < η →\n                    (∀ x ∈ N,\n                        ∃ L, ∃ U ∈ nhds x, LipschitzOnWith L (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field ⋯ χ v) U) →\n                      (∀ x ∈ N,\n                          ∀ g ∈ BfgsVerification.ConvexSubdifferential.subdifferential F x,\n                            η ≤ BfgsVerification.dot g (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field ⋯ χ v x)) →\n                        (∀ x ∈ N, ∀ (i : Fin m), ContDiffAt ℝ 1 (v i) (F x)) →\n                          (∀ x ∈ N,\n                              ContDiffAt ℝ 2 F x ∨\n                                ∃ i,\n                                  ∀ᶠ (z : BfgsVerification.Vec 2) in nhds x,\n                                    BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field ⋯ χ v z = v i (F z)) →\n                            (∀ x ∈ BfgsVerification.ClusterSetGeometry.clusterSet R.x,\n                                ∀ g ∈ BfgsVerification.ConvexSubdifferential.subdifferential F x,\n                                  ∀ h ∈ BfgsVerification.ConvexSubdifferential.subdifferential F x,\n                                    BfgsVerification.dot g (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field ⋯ χ v x) =\n                                      BfgsVerification.dot h (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field ⋯ χ v x)) →\n                              ∃ C,\n                                0 ≤ C ∧\n                                  ∃ J,\n                                    ∀ (k : ℕ),\n                                      J ≤ k →\n                                        ∃ lam β,\n                                          0 < lam ∧\n                                            BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field ⋯ χ v (R.x (k + 1)) =\n                                                lam • BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field ⋯ χ v (R.x k) +\n                                                  β • R.displacement k ∧\n                                              |Real.log lam| ≤ C * R.d k","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
