BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.normalized_return_contract","signature":"∀ (μ : ℝ),\n  BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.returnMap μ BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.seed =\n      BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.seed ∧\n    (∀ (j : Fin 3), 0 < BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.denominator μ BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.seed j) ∧\n      BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.returnFactor μ BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.seed =\n          BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedRatio ∧\n        (∃ U,\n            IsOpen U ∧\n              BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.seed ∈ U ∧\n                (∀ w ∈ U, BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.Regular μ w) ∧\n                  AnalyticOnNhd ℝ (BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.returnMap μ) U) ∧\n          (∀ (v : BfgsVerification.Vec 2),\n              (fderiv ℝ (BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.returnMap μ) BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.seed)\n                  (BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.pointLift v) =\n                BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedRatio⁻¹ • BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.pointLift v) ∧\n            (∀ (v : BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.State),\n                (fderiv ℝ (BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.returnMap μ) BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.seed) v\n                    4 =\n                  BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedRatio * v 4) ∧\n              ∀ (w : BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.State),\n                BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.returnFactor μ w ≠ 0 →\n                  BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.scale (BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.returnMap μ w) •\n                        BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.point (BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.returnMap μ w) =\n                      BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.scale w •\n                        (BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.internal μ w 3).1 ∧\n                    BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.scale (BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.returnMap μ w) •\n                        BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.shape (BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.returnMap μ w) =\n                      BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.scale w • (BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.internal μ w 3).2","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
