BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.FiniteMaxRadial.finite_max_inward_error","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {ι : Type u_1} [inst : Fintype ι] (hne : Finset.univ.Nonempty) {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ},\n  ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ F →\n    ∀ (f : ι → BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ) {U : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)},\n      IsOpen U →\n        (∀ (i : ι), ContDiffOn ℝ 2 (f i) U) →\n          ∀ {star : BfgsVerification.Vec n} {ρ : ℝ},\n            0 < ρ →\n              Metric.ball star ρ ⊆ U →\n                ∀ {M : NNReal},\n                  (∀ (i : ι), LipschitzOnWith M (fderiv ℝ (f i)) (Metric.ball star ρ)) →\n                    (∀ w ∈ U, F w = Finset.univ.sup' hne fun i => f i w) →\n                      (∀ w ∈ U,\n                          ∀ (i j : ι),\n                            f i w = F w → f j w = F w → (fderiv ℝ (f i) w) (w - star) = (fderiv ℝ (f j) w) (w - star)) →\n                        ∀ {x g : BfgsVerification.Vec n},\n                          x ∈ Metric.ball star (ρ / 4) →\n                            HasFDerivAt F (BfgsVerification.gradientFunctional g) x →\n                              ∀ {t : ℝ},\n                                t ∈ Set.Icc 0 (1 / 2) →\n                                  0 ≤\n                                      BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.supportingError F x g\n                                        (BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.inwardPoint star x t) ∧\n                                    BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.supportingError F x g\n                                        (BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.inwardPoint star x t) ≤\n                                      ↑M * ρ ^ 2 * t ^ 2","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
