BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.FiniteMaxRadial.active_gap_central_lower","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F f h : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} {U : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)},\n  ConvexOn ℝ U f →\n    ConvexOn ℝ U h →\n      (∀ x ∈ U, f x ≤ F x) →\n        (∀ x ∈ U, h x ≤ F x) →\n          ∀ {star w : BfgsVerification.Vec n},\n            w ∈ U →\n              f w = F w →\n                h w = F w →\n                  ∀ {g q : BfgsVerification.Vec n →L[ℝ] ℝ},\n                    HasFDerivAt f g w →\n                      HasFDerivAt h q w →\n                        ∀ (t : ℝ),\n                          BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.outwardPoint star w t ∈ U →\n                            BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.inwardPoint star w t ∈ U →\n                              t * (g (w - star) - q (w - star)) ≤\n                                BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.centralDifference F star w t","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
