BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AffineSupportPath.low_level_affine_correct_of_finite_path_cover","signature":"∀ {n m : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ},\n  ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ F →\n    ∀ (C : Fin m → Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)),\n      {p | BfgsVerification.AffineCriticalObjective.IsAffineCritical F p} = ⋃ i, C i →\n        (∀ (i : Fin m),\n            ∀ x ∈ C i, ∀ y ∈ C i, BfgsVerification.AffineSupportPath.PiecewiseDifferentiablePathIn F (C i) x y) →\n          ∀ (star : BfgsVerification.Vec n),\n            (∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n), F star ≤ F x) →\n              ∃ ε,\n                0 < ε ∧\n                  ∀ (p : BfgsVerification.Vec n),\n                    F p < F star + ε →\n                      BfgsVerification.AffineCriticalObjective.IsAffineCritical F p →\n                        0 ∈ BfgsVerification.ConvexSubdifferential.subdifferential F p","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
