BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.reference_value_budget_bound","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F) (star : BfgsVerification.Vec n),\n  (∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n), F star ≤ F x) →\n    ∀ (C : ℝ),\n      (∀ (k : ℕ), R.referenceCorrection star k ≤ C * (F (R.x (k + 1)) - F star)) →\n        ∀ (N : ℕ), (F (R.x N) - F star) ^ 2 * ∑ k ∈ Finset.range N, (R.q k)⁻¹ ≤ R.valueCorrectionBudget star C N","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
