BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.PlanarAllPairs.structured_all_pair_transport","signature":"∀ {F : BfgsVerification.Vec 2 → ℝ} (hF : ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ F) {K N : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec 2)},\n  IsCompact K →\n    IsOpen N →\n      K ⊆ N →\n        ∀ {m : ℕ} {χ : Fin m → BfgsVerification.Vec 2 → ℝ} {v : Fin m → ℝ → BfgsVerification.Vec 2},\n          (∀ (i : Fin m), ContDiff ℝ (↑⊤) (χ i)) →\n            ∀ {η : ℝ},\n              0 < η →\n                (∀ x ∈ N, ∃ L, ∃ U ∈ nhds x, LipschitzOnWith L (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v) U) →\n                  (∀ x ∈ N,\n                      ∀ g ∈ BfgsVerification.ConvexSubdifferential.subdifferential F x,\n                        η ≤ BfgsVerification.dot g (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v x)) →\n                    (∀ x ∈ N, ∀ (i : Fin m), ContDiffAt ℝ 1 (v i) (F x)) →\n                      (∀ x ∈ N,\n                          ContDiffAt ℝ 2 F x ∨\n                            ∃ i,\n                              ∀ᶠ (z : BfgsVerification.Vec 2) in nhds x,\n                                BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v z = v i (F z)) →\n                        (∀ x ∈ N,\n                            ∀ g ∈ BfgsVerification.ConvexSubdifferential.subdifferential F x,\n                              ∀ h ∈ BfgsVerification.ConvexSubdifferential.subdifferential F x,\n                                BfgsVerification.dot g (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v x) =\n                                  BfgsVerification.dot h (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v x)) →\n                          ∀ {c₁ c₂ : ℝ},\n                            0 < c₁ →\n                              c₂ < 1 →\n                                ∃ U Q,\n                                  IsOpen U ∧\n                                    K ⊆ U ∧\n                                      closure U ⊆ Q ∧\n                                        IsCompact Q ∧\n                                          Q ⊆ N ∧\n                                            ∃ κ δ C,\n                                              0 < κ ∧\n                                                0 < δ ∧\n                                                  0 ≤ C ∧\n                                                    ∀ x ∈ U,\n                                                      ∀ z ∈ U,\n                                                        ∀ (g h : BfgsVerification.Vec 2),\n                                                          BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.EligiblePair F c₁ c₂ x\n                                                              z g h →\n                                                            ‖z - x‖ < δ →\n                                                              (∀ θ ∈ Set.Icc 0 1,\n                                                                  x + θ • (z - x) ∈ Q ∧\n                                                                    κ * ‖BfgsVerification.euclideanVector (z - x)‖ ≤\n                                                                      |BfgsVerification.HomogeneousPlanar.pairDet\n                                                                          (z - x)\n                                                                          (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field\n                                                                            hF χ v (x + θ • (z - x)))|) ∧\n                                                                ∃ lam β,\n                                                                  0 < lam ∧\n                                                                    BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v\n                                                                          z =\n                                                                        lam •\n                                                                            BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field\n                                                                              hF χ v x +\n                                                                          β • (z - x) ∧\n                                                                      |Real.log lam| ≤\n                                                                        C *\n                                                                          BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.pairDecrease\n                                                                            x z g","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
