BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.exists_buffered_visible_comparison_field","signature":"∀ {F : BfgsVerification.Vec 2 → ℝ},\n  ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ F →\n    ∀ {K : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec 2)} {ℓ : ℝ},\n      IsCompact K →\n        (∀ x ∈ K, F x = ℓ) →\n          (∀ (x y : BfgsVerification.Vec 2), segment ℝ x y ⊆ frontier {w | F w ≤ ℓ} → x = y) →\n            (∀ x ∈ K, ContDiffAt ℝ 2 F x ∨ BfgsVerification.PlanarCornerCharts.TwoBranchRegularAt F x) →\n              (∀ x ∈ K, ¬BfgsVerification.AffineCriticalObjective.IsAffineCritical F x) →\n                ∃ W V Q N,\n                  IsOpen V ∧\n                    K ⊆ V ∧\n                      closure V ⊆ Q ∧\n                        IsCompact Q ∧\n                          Q ⊆ N ∧\n                            IsOpen N ∧\n                              ∃ η,\n                                0 < η ∧\n                                  ∃ M ρ,\n                                    0 < ρ ∧\n                                      ∃ G,\n                                        0 < G ∧\n                                          (∀ p ∈ Q, Metric.ball p ρ ⊆ N ∧ LipschitzOnWith M W (Metric.ball p ρ)) ∧\n                                            (∀ p ∈ Q, BfgsVerification.sqNorm (W p) ≤ G ^ 2) ∧\n                                              (∀ p ∈ Q, ‖fderiv ℝ W p‖ ≤ ↑M) ∧\n                                                (∀ p ∈ N,\n                                                    ∀ g ∈ BfgsVerification.ConvexSubdifferential.subdifferential F p,\n                                                      η ≤ BfgsVerification.dot g (W p)) ∧\n                                                  ∀ p ∈ K,\n                                                    ∀ g ∈ BfgsVerification.ConvexSubdifferential.subdifferential F p,\n                                                      ∀ h ∈ BfgsVerification.ConvexSubdifferential.subdifferential F p,\n                                                        BfgsVerification.dot g (W p) = BfgsVerification.dot h (W p)","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
