BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.TwoPieceBudget.raw_uniform_drop","signature":"∀ {c A B D X α A' B' D' X' : ℝ},\n  0 < c →\n    0 < A →\n      0 < B →\n        0 < D →\n          0 < α →\n            A' < 2 * B' →\n              A' = D * A / B ^ 2 + α * (A - 2 * B) ^ 2 / (2 * B) →\n                B' = α * (B - A / 2) →\n                  D' = α * A * D / (2 * B) →\n                    X' = α * B - X → α * (2 * B - (1 - c) * A) ≤ 2 * X → B' * X' / D' + c < B * X / D","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
