BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AnalyticStableGraph.exists_unique_orbits_radius","signature":"∀ {S : Type u_1} {U : Type u_2} [inst : NormedAddCommGroup S] [inst_1 : NormedSpace ℝ S] [inst_2 : CompleteSpace S]\n  [inst_3 : NormedAddCommGroup U] [inst_4 : NormedSpace ℝ U] [inst_5 : CompleteSpace U] (A : S →L[ℝ] S) (L : U ≃L[ℝ] U)\n  (T : S × U → S × U),\n  AnalyticAt ℝ T 0 →\n    T 0 = 0 →\n      HasFDerivAt T (A.prodMap ↑L) 0 →\n        ‖A‖ < 1 →\n          ‖↑L.symm‖ < 1 →\n            ∀ {r : ℝ},\n              0 < r →\n                ∃ R,\n                  0 < R ∧\n                    R ≤ r ∧\n                      ∀ (w v : ℕ → S × U),\n                        (∀ (n : ℕ), ‖w n‖ ≤ R) →\n                          (∀ (n : ℕ), ‖v n‖ ≤ R) →\n                            Filter.Tendsto w Filter.atTop (nhds 0) →\n                              Filter.Tendsto v Filter.atTop (nhds 0) →\n                                (w 0).1 = (v 0).1 →\n                                  (∀ (n : ℕ), w (n + 1) = T (w n)) → (∀ (n : ℕ), v (n + 1) = T (v n)) → w = v","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
