BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.CenteredSmoothSublinear.centered_rewriting","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F ψ γ : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} (star : BfgsVerification.Vec n),\n  (∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n), F star ≤ F x) →\n    ∀ {U : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)},\n      IsOpen U →\n        star ∈ U →\n          ConvexOn ℝ U ψ →\n            BfgsVerification.Homogeneous.PositiveDegreeOne γ →\n              (∀ x ∈ U, F x = ψ x + γ (x - star)) →\n                ∀ {p : BfgsVerification.Vec n},\n                  HasFDerivAt ψ (BfgsVerification.gradientFunctional p) star →\n                    (∀ x ∈ U, 0 ≤ BfgsVerification.CenteredSmoothSublinear.smoothRemainder ψ star p x) ∧\n                      BfgsVerification.CenteredSmoothSublinear.smoothRemainder ψ star p star = 0 ∧\n                        (∀ (z : BfgsVerification.Vec n),\n                            0 ≤ BfgsVerification.CenteredSmoothSublinear.recenteredHomogeneous γ p z) ∧\n                          BfgsVerification.CenteredSmoothSublinear.recenteredHomogeneous γ p 0 = 0 ∧\n                            ∀ x ∈ U,\n                              F x - F star =\n                                BfgsVerification.CenteredSmoothSublinear.smoothRemainder ψ star p x +\n                                  BfgsVerification.CenteredSmoothSublinear.recenteredHomogeneous γ p (x - star)","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
