cation.RealAlgebraicGeometry.fiberPolynomial\n                              (BfgsVerification.RealAlgebraicGeometry.survivingPolynomialProduct P Z)\n                              a).roots.toFinset.card +\n                      1))\n              (j : Fin m) {x y : BfgsVerification.Vec n × ℝ},\n              x ∈\n                  BfgsVerification.RealAlgebraicGeometry.orderedCylindricalCell S\n                    (fun i =>\n                      BfgsVerification.RealAlgebraicGeometry.orderedFiberRoot\n                        (BfgsVerification.RealAlgebraicGeometry.survivingPolynomialProduct P Z) ↑i)\n                    c →\n                y ∈\n                    BfgsVerification.RealAlgebraicGeometry.orderedCylindricalCell S\n                      (fun i =>\n                        BfgsVerification.RealAlgebraicGeometry.orderedFiberRoot\n                          (BfgsVerification.RealAlgebraicGeometry.survivingPolynomialProduct P Z) ↑i)\n                      c →\n                  SignType.sign (BfgsVerification.RealAlgebraicGeometry.parameterEval (P j) x) =\n                    SignType.sign (BfgsVerification.RealAlgebraicGeometry.parameterEval (P j) y)","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
