ometry.clusterSet R.x,\n                                  BfgsVerification.PlanarCrossing.LocalSecantControl F\n                                    (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field ⋯ χ v) (1 - R.c₂) p) →\n                                False","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
