BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.tangent_determinant_quotient_bound","signature":"∀ {g s : BfgsVerification.Vec 2},\n  g ≠ 0 →\n    s ≠ 0 →\n      ∀ (L : BfgsVerification.Vec 2 →L[ℝ] BfgsVerification.Vec 2),\n        (∀ (u : BfgsVerification.Vec 2), BfgsVerification.dot g u = 0 → BfgsVerification.dot g (L u) = 0) →\n          ∀ {M κ μ D : ℝ},\n            ‖L‖ ≤ M →\n              0 < κ →\n                0 < μ →\n                  μ ≤ ‖BfgsVerification.euclideanVector g‖ →\n                    κ * ‖BfgsVerification.euclideanVector s‖ ≤ |D| →\n                      |BfgsVerification.HomogeneousPlanar.pairDet s (L s) / D| ≤\n                        6 * M / (κ * μ) * |BfgsVerification.dot g s|","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
