BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.transformedGauge_correction_on_positive_band","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {Φ : ℝ → ℝ} {γ : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ},\n  BfgsVerification.TransformedGauge.IncreasingTransform Φ →\n    ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ γ →\n      BfgsVerification.Homogeneous.PositiveDegreeOne γ →\n        Filter.Tendsto γ (Filter.cocompact (BfgsVerification.Vec n)) Filter.atTop →\n          ∀ (star : BfgsVerification.Vec n)\n            (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n (BfgsVerification.TransformedGauge.objective Φ γ star)) {η : ℝ},\n            0 < η →\n              (∀ (k : ℕ), η ≤ BfgsVerification.TransformedGauge.objective Φ γ star (R.x k)) →\n                ∃ C,\n                  0 < C ∧\n                    ∀ (k : ℕ),\n                      R.referenceCorrection star k ≤\n                        (1 + C) ^ 2 / ((1 - R.c₂) * R.c₁) *\n                          (BfgsVerification.TransformedGauge.objective Φ γ star (R.x k) -\n                            BfgsVerification.TransformedGauge.objective Φ γ star (R.x (k + 1)))","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
