nt u)\n                                          (BfgsVerification.Parabolic.Example.newGradient u) <\n                                      BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.radialNumerator 0\n                                          (BfgsVerification.Parabolic.Example.newPoint u ρ ε)\n                                          (BfgsVerification.Parabolic.Example.oldGradient u)\n                                          (BfgsVerification.Parabolic.Example.newGradient u) ^\n                                        2 ∧\n                                    Matrix.PosDef (BfgsVerification.Parabolic.Example.initialMetric u A ρ ε) ∧\n                                      BfgsVerification.bfgsStep\n                                          (BfgsVerification.Parabolic.Example.initialMetric u A ρ ε)\n                                          (BfgsVerification.Parabolic.Example.oldGradient u) 1 =\n                                        BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.pairStep\n                                          (BfgsVerification.Parabolic.Example.oldPoint u ε)\n                                          (BfgsVerification.Parabolic.Example.newPoint u ρ ε)","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
