BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AffineKinks.local_kink_basin","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {ι : Type u_1} [inst : Fintype ι] {F ψ : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ},\n  ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ F →\n    ∀ (P : ι → BfgsVerification.AffineKinks.Kink n) {U : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)},\n      IsOpen U →\n        BfgsVerification.CenteredSmoothSublinear.LocallyC11On U ψ →\n          ∀ {star : BfgsVerification.Vec n},\n            star ∈ U →\n              (∀ x ∈ U, F x = ψ x + BfgsVerification.AffineKinks.penalty P x) →\n                (∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n), F star ≤ F x) →\n                  (∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n), F x = F star → x = star) →\n                    ∃ δ,\n                      0 < δ ∧\n                        ∀ (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F),\n                          F (R.x 0) ≤ F star + δ →\n                            (∀ (k : ℕ), R.x k ∈ U) ∧\n                              Filter.Tendsto (fun k => F (R.x k)) Filter.atTop (nhds (F star)) ∧\n                                Filter.Tendsto R.x Filter.atTop (nhds star)","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
