BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.variable_sample_radial_curvature_peak","signature":"∀ (n : ℕ) {c : BfgsVerification.Vec (n + 2)},\n  BfgsVerification.dot (BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.normal n) c = 0 →\n    ∀ (u : ℝ) (N : ℕ),\n      BfgsVerification.sqNorm (BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.sample n u (BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.scale N)) +\n            2 *\n                BfgsVerification.dot c\n                  (BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.sample n u (BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.scale N)) *\n              BfgsVerification.dot (BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.normal n)\n                (BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.sample n u (BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.scale N)) +\n          BfgsVerification.dot (BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.normal n)\n                (BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.sample n u (BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.scale N)) ^\n              2 *\n            BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.density\n              (BfgsVerification.dot (BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.normal n)\n                (BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.sample n u (BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.scale N))) =\n        u ^ 2 + BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.scale N ^ 2 + 2 * (c 1 * u) * BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.scale N +\n          (BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.scale N)⁻¹","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
