BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.PlanarScalarTransport.planar_transport_from_right_derivative_budget","signature":"∀ {φ : ℝ → ℝ} {W : BfgsVerification.Vec 2 → BfgsVerification.Vec 2} {x s : BfgsVerification.Vec 2} {D' : ℝ → ℝ}\n  {C d : ℝ},\n  0 ≤ C →\n    0 ≤ d →\n      ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ φ →\n        HasDerivAt φ (-d) 0 →\n          ContinuousOn (fun t => BfgsVerification.HomogeneousPlanar.pairDet s (W (x + t • s))) (Set.Icc 0 1) →\n            (∀ t ∈ Set.Icc 0 1, BfgsVerification.HomogeneousPlanar.pairDet s (W (x + t • s)) ≠ 0) →\n              (∀ t ∈ Set.Ico 0 1,\n                  HasDerivWithinAt (fun t => BfgsVerification.HomogeneousPlanar.pairDet s (W (x + t • s))) (D' t)\n                    (Set.Ici t) t) →\n                (∀ t ∈ Set.Ico 0 1,\n                    |D' t / BfgsVerification.HomogeneousPlanar.pairDet s (W (x + t • s))| ≤\n                      C * |derivWithin φ (Set.Ioi t) t|) →\n                  φ 1 ≤ φ 0 → ∃ lam β, 0 < lam ∧ W (x + s) = lam • W x + β • s ∧ |Real.log lam| ≤ 2 * C * d","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
