BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.RadialPower.sumObjective_inward","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {ι : Type u_1} [inst : Fintype ι] {Γ : ι → BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ},\n  (∀ (j : ι), BfgsVerification.Homogeneous.PositiveDegreeOne (Γ j)) →\n    (∀ (j : ι) (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n), 0 ≤ Γ j x) →\n      ∀ (p : ι → ℝ) (star x : BfgsVerification.Vec n) {t : ℝ},\n        t ≤ 1 →\n          BfgsVerification.RadialPower.sumObjective Γ p star (BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.inwardPoint star x t) =\n            ∑ j,\n              BfgsVerification.RadialPower.profile (p j) t * BfgsVerification.RadialPower.powered (Γ j) (p j) (x - star)","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
