BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.eventually_planar_field_secant","signature":"∀ {F : BfgsVerification.Vec 2 → ℝ} (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun 2 F),\n  IsCompact R.initialSublevel →\n    Filter.Tendsto R.displacement Filter.atTop (nhds 0) →\n      ∀ {W : BfgsVerification.Vec 2 → BfgsVerification.Vec 2},\n        (∀ p ∈ BfgsVerification.ClusterSetGeometry.clusterSet R.x,\n            BfgsVerification.PlanarCrossing.LocalSecantControl F W (1 - R.c₂) p) →\n          ∃ C0,\n            0 ≤ C0 ∧\n              ∃ J,\n                ∀ (k : ℕ), J ≤ k → BfgsVerification.dot (R.gradientChange k) (W (R.x (k + 1))) ^ 2 / R.curvature k ≤ C0","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
