BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.LShapeSpectralAlgebra.two_roots_of_signs","signature":"∀ {J : BfgsVerification.Mat 2},\n  0 < BfgsVerification.LShapeSpectralAlgebra.characteristic J (38 / 1000) →\n    BfgsVerification.LShapeSpectralAlgebra.characteristic J (39 / 1000) < 0 →\n      BfgsVerification.LShapeSpectralAlgebra.characteristic J (1564 / 1000) < 0 →\n        0 < BfgsVerification.LShapeSpectralAlgebra.characteristic J (1565 / 1000) →\n          ∃ ls lu,\n            (38 / 1000 < ls ∧ ls < 39 / 1000) ∧\n              (1564 / 1000 < lu ∧ lu < 1565 / 1000) ∧\n                BfgsVerification.LShapeSpectralAlgebra.characteristic J ls = 0 ∧\n                  BfgsVerification.LShapeSpectralAlgebra.characteristic J lu = 0 ∧\n                    ∀ (lam : ℝ), BfgsVerification.LShapeSpectralAlgebra.characteristic J lam = (lam - ls) * (lam - lu)","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
