BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.PlanarQuadraticExample.eligible_radial_unbounded_on_neighborhood","signature":"∀ {K : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec 2)},\n  K ∈ nhds 0 →\n    ∃ η,\n      0 < η ∧\n        ∀ (δ : ℝ),\n          0 < δ →\n            ∀ (C : ℝ),\n              ∃ x z g h H,\n                x ∈ K ∧\n                  z ∈ K ∧\n                    η ≤ BfgsVerification.PlanarQuadraticExample.objective z ∧\n                      BfgsVerification.PlanarQuadraticExample.objective z ≤\n                          BfgsVerification.PlanarQuadraticExample.objective x ∧\n                        BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.EligiblePair\n                            BfgsVerification.PlanarQuadraticExample.objective (1 / 4) (1 / 2) x z g h ∧\n                          BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.pairDecrease x z g ≤ δ ∧\n                            Matrix.PosDef H ∧\n                              BfgsVerification.bfgsStep H g 1 = BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.pairStep x z ∧\n                                C * BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.pairCurvature x z g h <\n                                  BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.radialNumerator 0 z g h ^ 2","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
