BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.FirstDifference.local_fullBFGS","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {weight : ℝ},\n  0 ≤ weight →\n    ∀ {ψ : BfgsVerification.Vec (n + 1) → ℝ},\n      ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ (BfgsVerification.FirstDifference.objective n weight ψ) →\n        ∀ {U : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec (n + 1))},\n          IsOpen U →\n            BfgsVerification.CenteredSmoothSublinear.LocallyC11On U ψ →\n              ∀ {star : BfgsVerification.Vec (n + 1)},\n                star ∈ U →\n                  (∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec (n + 1)),\n                      BfgsVerification.FirstDifference.objective n weight ψ star ≤\n                        BfgsVerification.FirstDifference.objective n weight ψ x) →\n                    (∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec (n + 1)),\n                        BfgsVerification.FirstDifference.objective n weight ψ x =\n                            BfgsVerification.FirstDifference.objective n weight ψ star →\n                          x = star) →\n                      ∃ δ,\n                        0 < δ ∧\n                          ∀\n                            (R :\n                              BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun (n + 1)\n                                (BfgsVerification.FirstDifference.objective n weight ψ)),\n                            BfgsVerification.FirstDifference.objective n weight ψ (R.x 0) ≤\n                                BfgsVerification.FirstDifference.objective n weight ψ star + δ →\n                              (∀ (k : ℕ), R.x k ∈ U) ∧\n                                Filter.Tendsto (fun k => BfgsVerification.FirstDifference.objective n weight ψ (R.x k))\n                                    Filter.atTop (nhds (BfgsVerification.FirstDifference.objective n weight ψ star)) ∧\n                                  Filter.Tendsto R.x Filter.atTop (nhds star)","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
