BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.printed_variable_quadratic_hessian_blocks","signature":"∀ (n : ℕ) (c : BfgsVerification.Vec (n + 1)) (x : BfgsVerification.Vec (n + 2)) (σ : ℝ),\n  let B :=\n    BfgsVerification.RadialHessian.matrix\n      (BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.variableQuadraticBranch (BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.normal n) (Fin.cons 0 c) σ) x;\n  B 0 0 = 1 ∧\n    (∀ (j : Fin (n + 1)), B 0 j.succ = σ * c j) ∧\n      (∀ (i : Fin (n + 1)), B i.succ 0 = σ * c i) ∧ ∀ (i j : Fin (n + 1)), B i.succ j.succ = if i = j then 1 else 0","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
