BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AnalyticStableGraph.sequenceMap_fixed_of_forward","signature":"∀ {S : Type u_1} {U : Type u_2} [inst : NormedAddCommGroup S] [inst_1 : NormedSpace ℝ S] [inst_2 : CompleteSpace S]\n  [inst_3 : NormedAddCommGroup U] [inst_4 : NormedSpace ℝ U] [inst_5 : CompleteSpace U] (A : S →L[ℝ] S) (L : U ≃L[ℝ] U)\n  (N : S × U → S × U) (hN : ContinuousAt N 0) (hN0 : N 0 = 0) (w : BfgsVerification.LocalStableOrbit.Sequence S U),\n  (∀ (n : ℕ), w (n + 1) = (A (w n).1, L (w n).2) + N (w n)) →\n    BfgsVerification.LocalStableOrbit.sequenceMap A (↑L.symm) N (w 0).1 hN hN0 w = w","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
