BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.source_accepted_inequalities","signature":"∀ {c₁ c₂ : ℝ},\n  0 < c₁ →\n    c₁ ≤ 1 / 3 →\n      0 < c₂ →\n        ∀ (j : Fin 3),\n          BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.objective BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedC BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedD\n                (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.trial BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedC BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedD\n                  BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedRatio j (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.length j)) <\n              BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.objective BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedC BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedD\n                  (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.point BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedC BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedD\n                    BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedRatio j) +\n                c₁ *\n                  BfgsVerification.dot\n                    (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.gradient BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedC\n                      BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedD j)\n                    (BfgsVerification.bfgsStep\n                      (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.metric BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedC\n                        BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedD j)\n                      (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.gradient BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedC\n                        BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedD j)\n                      (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.length j)) ∧\n            c₂ *\n                BfgsVerification.dot\n                  (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.gradient BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedC BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedD\n                    j)\n                  (BfgsVerification.bfgsStep\n                    (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.metric BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedC BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedD\n                      j)\n                    (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.gradient BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedC\n                      BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedD j)\n                    (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.length j)) <\n              BfgsVerification.dot\n                (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.gradient BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedC BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedD\n                  (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.nextPhase j))\n                (BfgsVerification.bfgsStep\n                  (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.metric BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedC BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedD\n                    j)\n                  (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.gradient BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedC BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedD\n                    j)\n                  (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.length j))","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
