BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.PlanarCrossing.convexCornerChart_local_secant","signature":"∀ {F : BfgsVerification.Vec 2 → ℝ},\n  ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ F →\n    ∀ {p : BfgsVerification.Vec 2} (c : BfgsVerification.PlanarCornerCharts.ConvexCornerChart F p)\n      {W : BfgsVerification.Vec 2 → BfgsVerification.Vec 2},\n      (∀ᶠ (z : BfgsVerification.Vec 2) in nhds p, W z = deriv c.curve (F z)) →\n        (∃ B, ∃ U ∈ nhds p, LipschitzOnWith B W U) →\n          ∀ {σ : ℝ},\n            0 < σ →\n              ∃ r δ C,\n                0 < r ∧\n                  0 < δ ∧\n                    0 ≤ C ∧\n                      ∀ (x z g h : BfgsVerification.Vec 2),\n                        x ∈ Metric.ball p r →\n                          z ∈ Metric.ball p r →\n                            ‖z - x‖ ≤ δ →\n                              HasFDerivAt F (BfgsVerification.gradientFunctional g) x →\n                                HasFDerivAt F (BfgsVerification.gradientFunctional h) z →\n                                  ∀ (d t : ℝ),\n                                    0 ≤ d →\n                                      0 < t →\n                                        BfgsVerification.dot g (z - x) = -d →\n                                          t = BfgsVerification.dot (h - g) (z - x) →\n                                            σ * d ≤ t → BfgsVerification.dot (h - g) (W z) ^ 2 / t ≤ C","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
