BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.ConvexCellRadial.full_derivative_eq_on_cell","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F f : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} {P U : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)},\n  Convex ℝ P →\n    (interior P).Nonempty →\n      IsOpen U →\n        ∀ {x : BfgsVerification.Vec n},\n          x ∈ P →\n            x ∈ U →\n              (∀ z ∈ U, z ∈ P → F z = f z) →\n                ∀ {g h : BfgsVerification.Vec n →L[ℝ] ℝ}, HasFDerivAt F g x → HasFDerivAt f h x → g = h","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
