BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.convergence_of_quadratic_corrections_unique_minimizer","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F)\n  (xStar : BfgsVerification.Vec n),\n  (∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n), F xStar ≤ F x) →\n    (∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n), F x = F xStar → x = xStar) →\n      ∀ (C : ℝ),\n        (∀ᶠ (N : ℕ) in Filter.atTop, ∑ k ∈ Finset.range N, R.referenceCorrection xStar k ≤ C * ↑N ^ 2) →\n          Filter.Tendsto (fun k => F (R.x k)) Filter.atTop (nhds (F xStar)) ∧\n            Filter.Tendsto R.x Filter.atTop (nhds xStar)","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
