BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.PlanarAllPairs.source_all_endpoint_estimates","signature":"∀ {F : BfgsVerification.Vec 2 → ℝ} (hF : ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ F) {K : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec 2)} {ℓ : ℝ},\n  IsCompact K →\n    (∀ x ∈ K, F x = ℓ) →\n      (∀ (x y : BfgsVerification.Vec 2), segment ℝ x y ⊆ frontier {w | F w ≤ ℓ} → x = y) →\n        (∀ x ∈ K, ContDiffAt ℝ 2 F x ∨ BfgsVerification.PlanarCornerCharts.ConvexTwoBranchRegularAt F x) →\n          (∀ x ∈ K, ¬BfgsVerification.AffineCriticalObjective.IsAffineCritical F x) →\n            ∀ {c₁ c₂ : ℝ},\n              0 < c₁ →\n                c₂ < 1 →\n                  ∃ m χ v,\n                    (∀ (i : Fin m), ContDiff ℝ (↑⊤) (χ i)) ∧\n                      ∃ U Q,\n                        IsOpen U ∧\n                          K ⊆ U ∧\n                            closure U ⊆ Q ∧\n                              IsCompact Q ∧\n                                ∃ η κ δ C C' C₀,\n                                  0 < η ∧\n                                    0 < κ ∧\n                                      0 < δ ∧\n                                        0 ≤ C ∧\n                                          0 ≤ C' ∧\n                                            0 ≤ C₀ ∧\n                                              (∀ x ∈ Q,\n                                                  ∃ L,\n                                                    ∃ V ∈ nhds x,\n                                                      LipschitzOnWith L\n                                                        (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v) V) ∧\n                                                (∀ x ∈ Q,\n                                                    ∀ g ∈ BfgsVerification.ConvexSubdifferential.subdifferential F x,\n                                                      η ≤\n                                                        BfgsVerification.dot g\n                                                          (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v x)) ∧\n                                                  (∀ x ∈ Q,\n                                                      ∀ g ∈ BfgsVerification.ConvexSubdifferential.subdifferential F x,\n                                                        ∀\n                                                          h ∈\n                                                            BfgsVerification.ConvexSubdifferential.subdifferential F x,\n                                                          BfgsVerification.dot g\n                                                              (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v x) =\n                                                            BfgsVerification.dot h\n                                                              (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v x)) ∧\n                                                    ∀ x ∈ U,\n                                                      ∀ z ∈ U,\n                                                        ∀ (g h : BfgsVerification.Vec 2),\n                                                          BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.EligiblePair F c₁ c₂ x\n                                                              z g h →\n                                                            ‖BfgsVerification.euclideanVector (z - x)‖ < δ →\n                                                              (∀ θ ∈ Set.Icc 0 1,\n                                                                  x + θ • (z - x) ∈ Q ∧\n                                                                    κ * ‖⋯‖ ≤\n                                                                      |BfgsVerification.HomogeneousPlanar.pairDet\n                                                                          (z - x) ⋯|) ∧\n                                                                BfgsVerification.dot (h - g)\n                                                                          (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field\n                                                                            hF χ v z) ^\n                                                                        2 /\n                                                                      BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.pairCurvature\n                                                                        x z g h ≤\n                                                                    C₀ ∧\n                                                                  ∃ lam β,\n                                                                    0 < lam ∧\n                                                                      BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v\n                                                                            z =\n                                                                          ⋯ ∧\n                                                                        |Real.log lam| ≤\n                                                                            C *\n                                                                              BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.pairDecrease\n                                                                                x z g ∧\n                                                                          (BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.pairDecrease\n                                                                                x z g ≤\n                                                                              1 →\n                                                                            lam ^ 2 ≤\n                                                                              1 +\n                                                                                C' *\n                                                                                  BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.pairDecrease\n                                                                                    x z g)","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
