BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.LBlockSplitting.positive_orbit_of_block","signature":"∀ {T : BfgsVerification.LBlockSplitting.State → BfgsVerification.LBlockSplitting.State}\n  {P : BfgsVerification.LBlockSplitting.State}\n  {F : BfgsVerification.LBlockSplitting.State →L[ℝ] BfgsVerification.LBlockSplitting.State},\n  T P = P →\n    HasStrictFDerivAt T F P →\n      P 4 = 0 →\n        ∀ {rho a b c d ls lu : ℝ} {p q h k : BfgsVerification.Vec 2},\n          BfgsVerification.LBlockSplitting.BlockForm F rho⁻¹ rho a b c d p q h k →\n            0 < rho →\n              rho < 1 →\n                0 < ls →\n                  ls < rho →\n                    1 < lu →\n                      lu < rho⁻¹ →\n                        b ≠ 0 →\n                          (ls - a) * (ls - d) = b * c →\n                            (lu - a) * (lu - d) = b * c →\n                              ∀ V ∈ nhds P,\n                                ∃ w,\n                                  (∀ (n : ℕ), w n ∈ V) ∧\n                                    Filter.Tendsto w Filter.atTop (nhds P) ∧ 0 < w 0 4 ∧ ∀ (n : ℕ), w (n + 1) = T (w n)","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
