BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.DEmbedding.objective_function_contract","signature":"(∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec 2),\n    BfgsVerification.DEmbedding.objective x = Finset.univ.sup' ⋯ fun i => BfgsVerification.DEmbedding.branch i x) ∧\n  (∀ (i : Fin 4),\n      ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ (BfgsVerification.DEmbedding.branch i) ∧\n        ContDiff ℝ 2 (BfgsVerification.DEmbedding.branch i)) ∧\n    ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ BfgsVerification.DEmbedding.objective ∧\n      BfgsVerification.DEmbedding.objective 0 = 0 ∧\n        (∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec 2), 0 ≤ BfgsVerification.DEmbedding.objective x) ∧\n          (∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec 2), BfgsVerification.DEmbedding.objective x = 0 ↔ x = 0) ∧\n            (∀ (a : ℝ), IsCompact {x | BfgsVerification.DEmbedding.objective x ≤ a}) ∧\n              ¬DifferentiableAt ℝ BfgsVerification.DEmbedding.objective 0 ∧\n                (∀ (h : BfgsVerification.Vec 2),\n                    Filter.Tendsto\n                      (fun t =>\n                        (BfgsVerification.DEmbedding.objective (t • h) - BfgsVerification.DEmbedding.objective 0) / t)\n                      (nhdsWithin 0 (Set.Ioi 0)) (nhds (max 0 (h 1)))) ∧\n                  (∀ (i : Fin 4) (x : BfgsVerification.Vec 2),\n                      Matrix.PosSemidef\n                          (BfgsVerification.RadialHessian.matrix (BfgsVerification.DEmbedding.branch i) x) ∧\n                        Matrix.PosSemidef\n                          (64 • 1 - BfgsVerification.RadialHessian.matrix (BfgsVerification.DEmbedding.branch i) x)) ∧\n                    ∀ (i : Fin 4) (x y : BfgsVerification.Vec 2),\n                      BfgsVerification.FrameNorms.euclideanOpNorm\n                          (BfgsVerification.RadialHessian.matrix (BfgsVerification.DEmbedding.branch i) x -\n                            BfgsVerification.RadialHessian.matrix (BfgsVerification.DEmbedding.branch i) y) ≤\n                        60000 * ‖BfgsVerification.euclideanVector (x - y)‖","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
