alizedReturn.seed) ∧\n                        0 < BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.scale (w 0) ∧\n                          ∀ (n : ℕ), w (n + 1) = BfgsVerification.LNormalizedReturn.returnMap μ (w n)","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
