BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.mixed_powers_convergence","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {ι : Type u_1} [inst : Fintype ι] {F ψ : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ}\n  (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F) {Γ : ι → BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ},\n  (∀ (j : ι), ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ (Γ j)) →\n    (∀ (j : ι), BfgsVerification.Homogeneous.PositiveDegreeOne (Γ j)) →\n      (∀ (j : ι) (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n), 0 ≤ Γ j x) →\n        ∀ (p : ι → ℝ),\n          (∀ (j : ι), 1 ≤ p j) →\n            ∀ (star : BfgsVerification.Vec n),\n              (∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n), F star ≤ F x) →\n                ∀ {U : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)},\n                  IsOpen U →\n                    BfgsVerification.CenteredSmoothSublinear.LocallyC11On U ψ →\n                      IsCompact R.initialSublevel →\n                        R.initialSublevel ⊆ U →\n                          (∀ x ∈ U, F x = ψ x + BfgsVerification.RadialPower.sumObjective Γ p star x) →\n                            Filter.Tendsto (fun k => F (R.x k)) Filter.atTop (nhds (F star)) ∧\n                              Filter.Tendsto (fun k => BfgsVerification.euclideanSolutionDistance F (R.x k))\n                                  Filter.atTop (nhds 0) ∧\n                                ((∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n), F x = F star → x = star) →\n                                  Filter.Tendsto R.x Filter.atTop (nhds star))","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
