BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.certificateOfScalarQuotient._proof_6","signature":"∀ {F : BfgsVerification.Vec 1 → ℝ} {K : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec 1)} {fstar c₁ c₂ η : ℝ},\n  c₂ < 1 →\n    (∀ x ∈ BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.positiveBand F K fstar η,\n        ∀ (g : BfgsVerification.Vec 1), HasFDerivAt F (BfgsVerification.gradientFunctional g) x → g 0 ≠ 0) →\n      ∀ (δ A : ℝ),\n        (∀ (x z g h : BfgsVerification.Vec 1),\n            x ∈ BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.positiveBand F K fstar η →\n              z ∈ BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.positiveBand F K fstar η →\n                BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.EligiblePair F c₁ c₂ x z g h →\n                  BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.pairDecrease x z g ≤ δ →\n                    |h 0 - g 0| / (|z 0 - x 0| * h 0 ^ 2) ≤ A) →\n          ∀ (x z g h : BfgsVerification.Vec 1),\n            x ∈ BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.positiveBand F K fstar η →\n              z ∈ BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.positiveBand F K fstar η →\n                BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.EligiblePair F c₁ c₂ x z g h →\n                  BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.pairDecrease x z g ≤ δ →\n                    BfgsVerification.metricEnergy\n                        ((BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.scalarGradient F z ^ 2)⁻¹ •\n                          BfgsVerification.outer (fun x => 1) fun x => 1)\n                        (h - g) ≤\n                      A * BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.pairCurvature x z g h","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
