BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.smooth_subspace_projection_trace_bound","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F) {r : ℕ}\n  (U : Matrix (Fin n) (Fin r) ℝ),\n  U.transpose * U = 1 →\n    ∀ (L : ℝ),\n      (∀ (k : ℕ), BfgsVerification.sqNorm ((U * U.transpose).mulVec (R.gradientChange k)) ≤ L * R.curvature k) →\n        ∀ (k : ℕ), (U * U.transpose * R.hessian k).trace ≤ (U * U.transpose * R.hessian 0).trace + L * ↑k","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
