BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.objective_tendsto_min_of_negligible_corrections","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F)\n  (xstar : BfgsVerification.Vec n),\n  (∀ (z : BfgsVerification.Vec n), F xstar ≤ F z) →\n    ∀ (G : ℝ),\n      0 < G →\n        (∀ (k : ℕ), BfgsVerification.sqNorm (R.g k) ≤ G ^ 2) →\n          Filter.Tendsto\n              (fun N => (∑ k ∈ Finset.range N, R.referenceCorrection xstar k) / ∑ k ∈ Finset.range N, (R.q k)⁻¹)\n              Filter.atTop (nhds 0) →\n            Filter.Tendsto (fun k => F (R.x k)) Filter.atTop (nhds (F xstar))","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
