BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.PlanarAllPairs.exists_all_endpoint_field","signature":"∀ {F : BfgsVerification.Vec 2 → ℝ} (hF : ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ F) {K : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec 2)} {ℓ : ℝ},\n  IsCompact K →\n    (∀ x ∈ K, F x = ℓ) →\n      (∀ (x y : BfgsVerification.Vec 2), segment ℝ x y ⊆ frontier {w | F w ≤ ℓ} → x = y) →\n        (∀ x ∈ K, ContDiffAt ℝ 2 F x ∨ BfgsVerification.PlanarCornerCharts.ConvexTwoBranchRegularAt F x) →\n          (∀ x ∈ K, ¬BfgsVerification.AffineCriticalObjective.IsAffineCritical F x) →\n            ∀ {σ : ℝ},\n              0 < σ →\n                ∃ m χ v,\n                  (∀ (i : Fin m), ContDiff ℝ (↑⊤) (χ i)) ∧\n                    ∃ N η,\n                      0 < η ∧\n                        IsOpen N ∧\n                          K ⊆ N ∧\n                            (∀ x ∈ N,\n                                ∃ L,\n                                  ∃ U ∈ nhds x,\n                                    LipschitzOnWith L (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v) U) ∧\n                              (∀ x ∈ N,\n                                  ∀ g ∈ BfgsVerification.ConvexSubdifferential.subdifferential F x,\n                                    η ≤ BfgsVerification.dot g (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v x)) ∧\n                                (∀ x ∈ N, ∀ (i : Fin m), ContDiffAt ℝ 1 (v i) (F x)) ∧\n                                  (∀ x ∈ N,\n                                      ContDiffAt ℝ 2 F x ∨\n                                        ∃ i,\n                                          ∀ᶠ (z : BfgsVerification.Vec 2) in nhds x,\n                                            BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v z = v i (F z)) ∧\n                                    (∀ x ∈ N,\n                                        ∀ g ∈ BfgsVerification.ConvexSubdifferential.subdifferential F x,\n                                          ∀ h ∈ BfgsVerification.ConvexSubdifferential.subdifferential F x,\n                                            BfgsVerification.dot g\n                                                (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v x) =\n                                              BfgsVerification.dot h\n                                                (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v x)) ∧\n                                      ∀ p ∈ K,\n                                        BfgsVerification.PlanarCrossing.LocalSecantControl F\n                                          (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v) σ p","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
