BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.planar_convergence_on_sublevel","signature":"∀ {F : BfgsVerification.Vec 2 → ℝ} (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun 2 F) (star : BfgsVerification.Vec 2),\n  (∀ (z : BfgsVerification.Vec 2), F star ≤ F z) →\n    ∀ (b : ℝ),\n      IsCompact {x | F x ≤ b} →\n        F (R.x 0) ≤ b →\n          (∀ (ℓ : ℝ),\n              F star < ℓ → ℓ ≤ b → ∀ (x y : BfgsVerification.Vec 2), segment ℝ x y ⊆ frontier {w | F w ≤ ℓ} → x = y) →\n            (∀ (p : BfgsVerification.Vec 2),\n                F p ≤ b →\n                  ¬BfgsVerification.AffineCriticalObjective.IsAffineCritical F p →\n                    ContDiffAt ℝ 2 F p ∨ BfgsVerification.PlanarCornerCharts.ConvexTwoBranchRegularAt F p) →\n              (∀ (p : BfgsVerification.Vec 2), F p ≤ b → BfgsVerification.AffineCriticalObjective.AffineCorrectAt F p) →\n                Filter.Tendsto (fun k => F (R.x k)) Filter.atTop (nhds (F star)) ∧\n                  Filter.Tendsto (fun k => Metric.infDist (R.x k) (BfgsVerification.argmin F)) Filter.atTop (nhds 0) ∧\n                    Filter.Tendsto (fun k => BfgsVerification.euclideanSolutionDistance F (R.x k)) Filter.atTop\n                        (nhds 0) ∧\n                      ((∀ (z : BfgsVerification.Vec 2), F z = F star → z = star) →\n                        Filter.Tendsto R.x Filter.atTop (nhds star))","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
