BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.DScalar.positivePart_interval","signature":"∀ {b x : ℝ},\n  2 ≤ b →\n    b ≤ 34 →\n      ∀ (m : ℕ),\n        b * BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.theta * BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.scale m ≤ x →\n          x ≤ b * BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.scale m →\n            BfgsVerification.DScalar.positivePart b x =\n              (BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.theta * BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.scale m) ^ 3 +\n                b * BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.scale m ^ 3 * (1 - BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.theta) *\n                  (BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.theta ^ 2 *\n                      BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.coordinate b (BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.scale m) x +\n                    (1 - BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.theta ^ 2) *\n                      BfgsVerification.DScalarRamp.primitive b\n                        (BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.coordinate b (BfgsVerification.DScalarGeometric.scale m) x))","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
