BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.ScaledCopy.Data.query_value","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {Q F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} {c : BfgsVerification.Vec n} {C : ℝ} {U : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)}\n  (D : BfgsVerification.ScaledCopy.Data Q F c C U) (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n Q)\n  (hx : ∀ (k : ℕ), R.x k ∈ U) (m k : ℕ) (a : ℝ),\n  R.x k + a • BfgsVerification.bfgsStep (R.H k) (R.g k) 1 ∈ U →\n    F ((D.run R hx m).x k + a • BfgsVerification.bfgsStep ((D.run R hx m).H k) ((D.run R hx m).g k) 1) =\n      BfgsVerification.LScalarGeometric.scale m ^ 2 * (C + Q (R.x k + a • BfgsVerification.bfgsStep (R.H k) (R.g k) 1))","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
