BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.RealAlgebraicGeometry.ordered_cylindrical_smooth_partition","signature":"∀ {E : Type u_1} [inst : NormedAddCommGroup E] [inst_1 : NormedSpace ℝ E] {r : ℕ} (S : Set E) (f : Fin r → E → ℝ),\n  BfgsVerification.RealAlgebraicGeometry.PiecewiseSmoothConnected S →\n    (∀ (i : Fin r), ContDiffOn ℝ (↑⊤) (f i) S) →\n      (∀ x ∈ S, StrictMono fun i => f i x) →\n        ⋃ i, BfgsVerification.RealAlgebraicGeometry.orderedCylindricalCell S f i = {z | z.1 ∈ S} ∧\n          (Pairwise fun i j =>\n              Disjoint (BfgsVerification.RealAlgebraicGeometry.orderedCylindricalCell S f i)\n                (BfgsVerification.RealAlgebraicGeometry.orderedCylindricalCell S f j)) ∧\n            ∀ (i : Fin r ⊕ Fin (r + 1)),\n              BfgsVerification.RealAlgebraicGeometry.PiecewiseSmoothConnected\n                (BfgsVerification.RealAlgebraicGeometry.orderedCylindricalCell S f i)","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
