BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.projected_displacement_sq_le","signature":"∀ {n m : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F)\n  (P : BfgsVerification.Vec n →ₗ[ℝ] BfgsVerification.Vec m) {U : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)} {μ : ℝ},\n  0 < μ →\n    (ConvexOn ℝ U fun x => F x - μ / 2 * BfgsVerification.sqNorm (P x)) →\n      (∀ (k : ℕ), R.x k ∈ U) → ∀ (k : ℕ), BfgsVerification.sqNorm (P (R.displacement k)) ≤ 2 / μ * R.d k","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
