BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.ScaledCopy.Data.run_values_tendsto","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {Q F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} {c : BfgsVerification.Vec n} {C : ℝ} {U : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)}\n  (D : BfgsVerification.ScaledCopy.Data Q F c C U) (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n Q)\n  (hx : ∀ (k : ℕ), R.x k ∈ U),\n  Filter.Tendsto (fun k => Q (R.x k)) Filter.atTop (nhds 0) →\n    ∀ (m : ℕ),\n      Filter.Tendsto (fun k => F ((D.run R hx m).x k)) Filter.atTop\n        (nhds (BfgsVerification.LScalarGeometric.scale m ^ 2 * C))","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
