erification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v z =\n                                                                      lam •\n                                                                          BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF\n                                                                            χ v x +\n                                                                        β • (z - x) ∧\n                                                                    |Real.log lam| ≤\n                                                                        C *\n                                                                          BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.pairDecrease\n                                                                            x z g ∧\n                                                                      (BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.pairDecrease\n                                                                            x z g ≤\n                                                                          1 →\n                                                                        lam ^ 2 ≤\n                                                                          1 +\n                                                                            C' *\n                                                                              BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.pairDecrease\n                                                                                x z g)","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
