BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.scalar_certificate_iff_eligible_lipschitz","signature":"∀ {F : BfgsVerification.Vec 1 → ℝ} {K : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec 1)},\n  ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ F →\n    ∀ (star : BfgsVerification.Vec 1),\n      IsCompact K →\n        ∀ {c₁ c₂ η : ℝ},\n          c₂ < 1 →\n            0 < η →\n              (Nonempty (BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.BandCertificate F K (F star) c₁ c₂ η) ↔\n                BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.ScalarEligibleLipschitz F K (F star) c₁ c₂ η)","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
