BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.RadialPower.powered_radial_second_derivative_bounded","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {γ : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ},\n  ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ γ →\n    BfgsVerification.Homogeneous.PositiveDegreeOne γ →\n      (∀ (z : BfgsVerification.Vec n), 0 ≤ γ z) →\n        ∀ {p : ℝ},\n          1 ≤ p →\n            ∀ {K : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)},\n              Bornology.IsBounded K →\n                ∃ M,\n                  0 < M ∧\n                    ∀ z ∈ K,\n                      ∀ t ∈ Set.Icc 0 (1 / 2),\n                        |deriv (deriv fun u => BfgsVerification.RadialPower.powered γ p ((1 - u) • z)) t| ≤ M","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
