BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.RidgeSupersession.localized_fullBFGS_convergence","signature":"∀ {a b : ℝ → ℝ},\n  ContDiff ℝ 2 a →\n    ContDiff ℝ 2 b →\n      ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ a →\n        ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ b →\n          ∀ {p q u : ℝ},\n            0 < p →\n              0 < q →\n                (∀ (t : ℝ),\n                    BfgsVerification.RidgeSupersession.profile a b p q u ≤\n                      BfgsVerification.RidgeSupersession.profile a b p q t) →\n                  (∀ (t : ℝ),\n                      BfgsVerification.RidgeSupersession.profile a b p q t =\n                          BfgsVerification.RidgeSupersession.profile a b p q u →\n                        t = u) →\n                    (∀ (t : ℝ), t ≠ u → 0 < deriv (deriv a) t) →\n                      (∀ (t : ℝ), t ≠ u → 0 < deriv (deriv b) t) →\n                        ∀ U ∈ nhds (BfgsVerification.RidgeSupersession.optimizer a b p q u),\n                          ∃ ε,\n                            0 < ε ∧\n                              ∀\n                                (R :\n                                  BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun 2\n                                    (BfgsVerification.RidgeSupersession.objective a b p q)),\n                                BfgsVerification.RidgeSupersession.objective a b p q (R.x 0) ≤\n                                    BfgsVerification.RidgeSupersession.profile a b p q u + ε →\n                                  (∀ (k : ℕ), R.x k ∈ U) ∧\n                                    Filter.Tendsto\n                                        (fun k => BfgsVerification.RidgeSupersession.objective a b p q (R.x k))\n                                        Filter.atTop (nhds (BfgsVerification.RidgeSupersession.profile a b p q u)) ∧\n                                      Filter.Tendsto R.x Filter.atTop\n                                        (nhds (BfgsVerification.RidgeSupersession.optimizer a b p q u))","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.soun