BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.run._proof_1","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} (A : BfgsVerification.Mat n) {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ},\n  BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F →\n    Convex ℝ Set.univ ∧\n      ∀ ⦃x : BfgsVerification.Vec n⦄,\n        x ∈ Set.univ →\n          ∀ ⦃y : BfgsVerification.Vec n⦄,\n            y ∈ Set.univ →\n              ∀ ⦃a b : ℝ⦄,\n                0 ≤ a →\n                  0 ≤ b →\n                    a + b = 1 →\n                      BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.objective A F (a • x + b • y) ≤\n                        a • BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.objective A F x +\n                          b • BfgsVerification.AffineWhitening.objective A F y","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
