BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.RealAlgebraicGeometry.localCauchyIndex_rational_reciprocity","signature":"∀ {p q : Polynomial ℝ},\n  p ≠ 0 →\n    q ≠ 0 →\n      ∀ (a : ℝ),\n        BfgsVerification.RealAlgebraicGeometry.localCauchyIndex (fun x => Polynomial.eval x p / Polynomial.eval x q) a +\n            BfgsVerification.RealAlgebraicGeometry.localCauchyIndex (fun x => Polynomial.eval x q / Polynomial.eval x p)\n              a =\n          if Odd (Polynomial.rootMultiplicity a p + Polynomial.rootMultiplicity a q) then\n            ↑(SignType.sign\n                (Polynomial.eval a (BfgsVerification.RealAlgebraicGeometry.rootFactor p a) *\n                  Polynomial.eval a (BfgsVerification.RealAlgebraicGeometry.rootFactor q a)))\n          else 0","axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]}
