  BfgsVerification.TransformedGauge.IncreasingTransform.strictMono : StrictMonoOn Φ (Set.Ici 0)
  BfgsVerification.TransformedGauge.IncreasingTransform.zero : Φ 0 = 0
  BfgsVerification.TransformedGauge.IncreasingTransform.smooth : ContDiffOn ℝ 2 Φ (Set.Ioi 0)
